# Lelet launch status

This branch holds the numbers of the Lelet launch test. A GitHub Action writes here every night
at 00:35 Jakarta time. Nothing here is edited by hand.

- `STATUS.md`: where the test stands today.
- `VERDICT.md`: appears once, after the test ends on 12 December 2026.
- `status.json`: the saved counts behind both pages.

The app and the scripts live on the `main` branch: https://github.com/juw12/lelet
